SUMMARY:IU Research Data Commons Virtual Resource Fair
DESCRIPTION:Whether you're a faculty member\, staff member\, postdoc\, or
  student\, this virtual fair is your gateway to the resources that power 
 successful research workflows—from planning and data discovery to analy
 sis\, sharing\, and compliance.Connect personally — Join a drop-in Zoom
  session on Tuesday\, September 15th\, 11 AM - 1 PM ET to speak with rese
 arch data experts about a project\, ask questions\, and get individualize
 d guidance.Address real challenges — Discover resources tailored to you
 r needs\, from managing complex datasets to preparing data sharing plans 
 and meeting funder requirements.Stay productive and efficient — All res
 ources are curated to help you get your research done smarter and faster.
   For more information\, visit the fair website. (https://researchdata.iu
 .edu/virtual-resource-fair/)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Whether you're a faculty member\, staff
  member\, postdoc\, or student\, this virtual fair is your gateway to the
  resources that power successful research workflows—from planning and d
 ata discovery to analysis\, sharing\, and compliance.</p><p><strong>Conne
 ct personally</strong> — Join a drop-in Zoom session on Tuesday\, Septe
 mber 15th\, 11 AM - 1 PM ET to speak with research data experts about a p
 roject\, ask questions\, and get individualized guidance.<br /><br /><str
 ong>Address real challenges</strong> — Discover resources tailored to y
 our needs\, from managing complex datasets to preparing data sharing plan
